Translation patch: <States>::send (spqr::v1::chunked::states)

Change: the `log::info!` calls are gated on `not(any(hax, feature = "extraction"))` instead of
`not(hax)`.
Why: `log` is excluded from the translation; its macros make Aeneas fail ("Internal error").
Behaviour: identical (only with `extraction`: no log output).
Relies on: Cargo-features.patch (defines the `extraction` feature).

diff --git a/src/v1/chunked/states.rs b/src/v1/chunked/states.rs
